The keys in effect, and every command by category                                        73 commands

╭──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ Keys                                                                                             │
│ enter                         send the prompt                                                    │
│ shift+enter / alt+enter / ctrl+j                                                                 │
│                               new line                                                           │
│ esc                           hand a question on, or stop the main agent's turn                  │
│ ctrl+c                        clear the prompt, twice to exit                                    │
│ ctrl+d                        exit, twice on an empty prompt                                     │
│ shift+tab                     next approval mode                                                 │
│ ctrl+o                        detailed transcript                                                │
│ ctrl+t                        workflow view                                                      │
│ ctrl+g / ctrl+x ctrl+e        edit the prompt in $EDITOR                                         │
│ left                          agent panel, on an empty prompt                                    │
│ down                          agent panel, on an empty prompt                                    │
│ ctrl+r                        search prompt history                                              │
│ ?                             shortcuts, on an empty prompt                                      │
│ up                            take queued messages back                                          │
│ tab / up                      answer a waiting question                                          │
│ ctrl+enter / ctrl+x ctrl+s    send waiting messages to Claude Code now                           │
│ alt+w                         ignore the word ultracode in this prompt, or undo                  │
│ ctrl+x ctrl+k                 stop every background agent, twice to confirm                      │
│ ctrl+]                        open the most recent artifact in the browser                       │
│ ctrl+x tab                    move to the mods and the notice above the input                    │
│ ctrl+x ctrl+a                 hide or show everything above the input                            │
│ ctrl+s                        in a settings picker, keep the pick for this session only          │
│ ctrl+z                        suspend Argonauts Code; fg brings it back                          │
│ ctrl+x c                      show or hide context above the input                               │
